---
const tooling = [
  "React",
  "TypeScript",
  "JavaScript",
  "Capacitor",
  "SCSS",
  "Node.js",
  "Express",
  "MongoDB",
  "Git",
  "Python",
  "PostgreSQL",
  "Supabase",
  "Testing",
  "CI/CD",
]
---

<article class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-slate-300 md:flex-row">
  <div
    class="order-2 text-pretty [&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>a]:underline-offset-4 [&>p>a]:transition-colors [&>p>a]:hover:text-[rgb(var(--color-accent))] [&>p>a>strong]:font-mono [&>p>a>strong]:font-normal [&>p>a>strong]:text-[rgb(var(--color-accent))] md:order-1"
  >
    <p class="[&>strong]:font-mono [&>strong]:font-normal [&>strong]:font-bold [&>strong]:text-[rgb(var(--color-accent))]">
      I'm Jaime, a <strong>Full-Stack Software Developer</strong> with experience building modern web applications across both <strong>frontend</strong> and <strong>backend</strong>. I work with technologies such as React, TypeScript, JavaScript, Node, databases and modern development tools to create reliable and maintainable software.
    </p>

    <p class="[&>strong]:font-mono [&>strong]:font-normal [&>strong]:font-bold [&>strong]:text-[rgb(var(--color-accent))]">
      I enjoy understanding how a product works as a whole, from the user interface to the services, data and architecture behind it. I’m especially interested in building clean solutions, improving existing systems and making thoughtful technical decisions that keep products simple and scalable.
    </p>

    <p class="[&>strong]:font-mono [&>strong]:font-normal [&>strong]:font-bold [&>strong]:text-[rgb(var(--color-accent))]">
      I’m continuously expanding my skills in backend development, system design, cloud technologies and AI integration, while building personal projects that allow me to experiment, learn and turn ideas into real products.
    </p>

    <p>
      Technologies I use most often:
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,_minmax(150px,_1fr))] gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
      {tooling.map((tool) => (
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[rgb(var(--color-accent))]">&gt;</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-[rgb(var(--color-text-muted))]">{tool}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
